  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-07_beg",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-07",
  "title": "Roar",
  "storyCode": "3-7",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e1ad286cbb2fd0949c07c85c7a19b535876b49350885275ff37a7ed8448eaca2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十九关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "We've broken through the first defensive line!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "What are the casters doing?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Even though there's only one enemy in the vanguard...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Why are they just watching her tear us apart?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Hurry, hurry! Take her out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Franka! You're getting out of range!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "I can't... give you cover from here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Do I look that reckless to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Watch your four o'clock!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Liskarm, it's time for your debut!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Be a sweetie and block the enemy's ranged attacks, won't you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Tsk...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Quick! Faster!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Focus down the one with the sword first!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Did we get her--?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Don't even think about it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "You call those attacks, or are you just throwing sticks and stones?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Woah!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Wh-where'd this one come from?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "I owe you one, Cap'n!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "My pleasure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "However, Franka, your task was to launch a feint attack.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Instead, you fought your way all the way here. You have a huge target over your head now. Is that fine with you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "Sure is, after all, I have a trusty partner after all!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Ugh... Gahh...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Franka! You charged way too far ahead!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "text": "See? She caught up to us.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "I'm not used to this kind of stuff...! Why are you making me charge headlong into the enemy? I don't get it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "...Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Curses...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "L.G.D. and Rhodes Island are working together!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "There's no way we can defend this place...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "We can't afford to hesitate. It's do or die. Everyone, chaaarge!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "The enemies are rushing straight at us!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Dieeeee!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "If you plan to resist, you leave me with no choice. Don't take it personally.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "You...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "...!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "text": "Aaaaaaaaghhh!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "Madam, you're... quite strong.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "text": "That Reunion fellow... Not his lucky day.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "They've got some nerve to attack us like that...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "I feel bad for him.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "They should apologize to those who died unjustly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Inspector!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "I'm glad to see that you're all fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "We've collapsed their flank! The next step is to launch our all-out assault.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Fine by me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Everything seems to be going smoothly.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "That probably won't last for much longer. The enemies have set up many obstacles, and are doing a good job of staying hidden.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Amiya, be prepared for a hard fight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, make sure you scout things out thoroughly and protect your squads!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Of course!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "text": "Everyone, let's go rescue Misha together!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
